trying to get at.

807
00:58:26.283 --> 00:58:27.366
We were happily married.

808
00:58:27.574 --> 00:58:30.033
- You can ask anyone.
- We did...

809
00:58:30.699 --> 00:58:34.408
- Your neighbor.
- My neighbor? What did she say?

810
00:58:35.366 --> 00:58:36.741
See for yourself.

811
