you had an argument.

814
00:58:59.283 --> 00:59:01.033
And two days later Katherine
ended up up dead.

815
00:59:01.199 --> 00:59:03.324
I admit Katherine and
I had an argument

816
00:59:04.283 --> 00:59:05.908
but, you don't know
the reason behind it.

817
00:59:05.991 --> 00:59:08.658
