Katherine... and her father.

818
00:59:09.699 --> 00:59:11.033
But you still leaked her name.

819
00:59:11.408 --> 00:59:13.366
<i>Katherine published this
book at her own risk.</i>

820
00:59:13.574 --> 00:59:16.783
