No one can.

824
00:59:25.491 --> 00:59:26.949
<i>She was doing all this for us.</i>

825
00:59:28.116 --> 00:59:30.449
<i>But Sandhya's name
shouldn't have leaked out.</i>

826
00:59:31.616 --> 00:59:32.866
