- Ready?
- Throw...!

862
01:02:08.033 --> 01:02:09.241
Did you catch it?

863
01:02:09.866 --> 01:02:11.158
So that means we've nothing.

864
01:02:11.241 --> 01:02:13.366
No-no, sir. There is one thing.

865
01:02:15.158 --> 01:02:17.158
Sir, Shekhar Sinha's
height was 6 feet

866
