on the murder weapon.

892
01:03:47.783 --> 01:03:50.408
- I want to talk to Dev.
- Fine... get up.

893
01:03:50.491 --> 01:03:53.033
Stop with your English... I'll
make you sing in Marathi.

894
01:03:53.116 --> 01:03:54.199
Hold on... I want to talk to Dev.

895
